    {
      "id": "p0120-b007",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "When's the human getting here? I need to dress in my yoso-iki [going somewhere formal] clothes ... or at least in my gokinjo-iki [going somewhere in the neighborhood] clothes!",
