    {
      "id": "p0120-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "As we can see, the new Japanese text plays with the standard word yoso-iki by creating the made-up word gokinjo-iki. The end result is a Japanese joke that uses completely different wording to parallel the logic of the original English joke.",
