    {
      "id": "p0120-b010",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "A localization team member explained the goal for Papyrus' text early on: \"You can Google a lot of Papyrus's lines and he is the first search result because no one else has ever said anything like it. That's the kind of dialogue we should be striving for with him.\"",
        "raw": "A localization team member explained the goal for Papyrus' text early\non: \"You can Google a lot of Papyrus's lines and he is the first search\nresult because no one else has ever said anything like it. That's the kind of\ndialogue we should be striving for with him.\"",
